title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-03-org-policy-guardrails/
├── LAB.md              reproduction guide: the baseline read, the 409, the lag
├── terraform/          8 resources: 4 policies, a custom constraint, 1 exception
├── scripts/            validate.sh, measure-enforcement-lag.py
└── docs/               figure plan, references, screenshots

# terraform/  the resources are chained with depends_on - the API serializes
#             per parent and HCP refuses -parallelism=1.
# scripts/    measure-enforcement-lag.py restores the control in a finally
#             block, because its first version crashed and left one degraded.
